      "fact": "Frozen42ab product and independent dd4a driver identities were hash verified. The actual product arguments were --settings --diagnostic on the exact active Medium Run desktop, not ordinary no-argument entry. Product PID5660 and exact new Terminal PID3012/root131926/TID3108 passed actual same-SID/session/Medium membership, foreground/GUI and VDM checks. This does not award tray, client semantics or full desktop."
    },
    {
      "source": "D779-D810/P19-P110",
      "fact": "The first three actual gestures completed on the same Terminal: Move(+72,+36), right-edge Resize(+64,0) with the other three edges unchanged, then successor Move(-36,+24). Each generation had true native START, bounded cancel, actual END/handoff/capture, a successful exact placement and independently observed Raw UP/accepted legacy UP/release/detach/overlay Gone/NormalUp. These are three completed gestures, not the later five-phase magnet or Ctrl result."
